  "instructions": [
    "1. Heat the sesame oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "2. Add the Thai red chilies and cook for 1-2 minutes, until fragrant.",
    "3. Add the garlic and ginger and cook for another minute.",
    "4. Add the Canadian beef (if using) and cook until browned.",
    "5. Add the eggplant and cook until tender.",
    "6. Stir in the coconut milk, soy sauce, and honey. Bring to a simmer.",
    "7. Reduce heat to low and let simmer for 5-7 minutes.",
    "8. Taste and adjust seasoning with salt and pepper.",
    "9. Garnish with Thai basil and serve over a bowl of steamed rice or noodles.",
    "10. Enjoy!"
  ],
